  "question": {
    "text": "If <math><mn>5</mn><msup><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>53</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></math> is divided by <math><mn>10</mn><mo>,</mo></math> then the remainder obtained is"
  },
